    "layers": {
      "items": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "One entry in the design stack (``TemplateConfig.layers``, bottom to top).\n\n``text`` layers only reference a placeholder by id (``id == placeholder id``): its geometry, visibility and lock\nstate live on the placeholder. Image and shape layers carry their own geometry; ``rotation`` is clockwise\ndegrees around the box centre.",
